  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n (x+(1)/(x))=10\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nIf (x + 1/x) = P\n\nthen (x² + 1/x²) = P² - 2\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (x + 1/x) = 10\n\n⇒ (x2 + 1/x2) = 10² - 2\n\n⇒ (x2 + 1/x2) = (100 - 2) = 98\n\n⇒ (x⁴ + 1/x⁴) = (98)² - 2\n\n⇒ (x4 + 1/x4) = 9604 - 2 = 9602\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 9602.**",
